,0.413,0.254,0.086,0.007,0.573,0.38,0.262,0.285,0.202,0.253,0.31,0.258,0.148,0.051,0.008,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"ARTHUR: Ha! GOT YOU! You’ve been a naughty—Ah! Whoa! Bad wyvern!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":12},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"NARRATOR: Time freezes as Brighid’s mind recognises her brother in this state between sleep and wakefulness. Between them is a glassy film, the wall between the fae and material realms. On one side, a knight astride a snapping wyvern, with short white-blond hair and vivid green eyes. On the other, Brighid resting at a counter, a Fae with the same hair, but longer, and silver mirror-like eyes.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":15.424,"end":45.216,"frac":0.942,"status":"ok","matched":65,"words":69},"large":{"start":15.424,"end":45.216,"frac":0.942,"status":"ok","matched":65,"words":69},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"ARTHUR: Brighid! Impressed by the ride? How’re you?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":46.08,"end":48.46,"frac":0.5,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":8},"large":{"start":46.08,"end":48.38,"frac":0.625,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"BRIGHID: …Hi Arthur . Very impressed. I’m good, another slow day in…oh bother, I’ll tell him next time, if the connection holds longer. [ yawn ] No one came while I napped, Derry?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":31},"large":{"start":48.38,"end":64.352,"frac":0.871,"status":"ok","matched":27,"words":31},"differ":true},{"i":4,"text":"DERRY: [ cackle ] GHOST TOWN, POPULATION OF ONE!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":7},"large":{"start":65.30000000000001,"end":68.18,"frac":0.714,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":7},"differ":true},{"i":5,"text":"BRIGHID: I thought so. I’ll just finish this box of acquisitions then.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":12},"large":{"start":69.984,"end":73.664,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"differ":true},{"i":6,"text":"NARRATOR: Brighid removes one of her gloves and reaches inside the box. There’s a hole at the ring finger of the glove so she can touch and feel out surface impressions without overloading her senses. Anything deeper requires a more… hands-on approach.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":48.46,"end":89.984,"frac":0.977,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":43},"large":{"start":74.56,"end":89.984,"frac":0.953,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":43},"differ":true},{"i":7,"text":"NARRATOR: The first item to meet her touch is a silver spoon set. They must have faded away in an auntie’s drawer until someone wondered their worth. Brighid presses her finger more firmly to the metal and sinks a little deeper…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":90.912,"end":104.672,"frac":0.951,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":41},"large":{"start":90.912,"end":104.672,"frac":0.951,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":41},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"BRIGHID: Tea. Black. White. Green. A ritual over years, accompanied by a splash of cream. Suffocating company. Why did she let them talk her into meeting this boor? He told her she should smile. He foolishly accepted the beatific attempt as she considered , ‘Should I use this spoon to carve out his heart?’","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":105.952,"end":133.728,"frac":0.981,"status":"ok","matched":52,"words":53},"large":{"start":105.952,"end":133.728,"frac":0.981,"status":"ok","matched":52,"words":53},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"NARRATOR: Her amusement snaps Brighid out of her trance.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":134.304,"end":137.344,"frac":0.778,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":9},"large":{"start":134.304,"end":137.22,"frac":0.778,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"BRIGHID: As she should…no blood stains, disappointing. Good for sale, though, two hundred Laress at least. What else do we have?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":137.76,"end":146.048,"frac":0.864,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":22},"large":{"start":137.76,"end":146.048,"frac":0.909,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":22},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d81c3b87d_5-1a.jpg"}